# Recordings. Kept on disk deliberately - CALIBRATION.md treats them as journal
# evidence and --replay runs against them - but they are tens of megabytes of
# binary that git can only store whole, and a new one is produced every session.
*.wav

# Listener output and analysis runs. Regenerated on every start; snap.log is
# held open by the running listener.
*.log
*.log.session*
*.marker

# Superseded by version control itself.
*.bak-*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
